   "file": "TauCeti/Analysis/Matrix/CovariancePseudoInverse.lean",
   "fix": "Add `toEuclideanLin_covariancePseudoInverse_mul : (C.covariancePseudoInverse * C).toEuclideanLin = C.toEuclideanLin.range.starProjection` and `isHermitian_covariancePseudoInverse_mul`, both via `(commute_covariancePseudoInverse C).eq`.",
